# Build context is site/ (see web/Dockerfile). Never send host installs or
# old builds: node_modules holds macOS native bindings that would break the Linux build.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.DS_Store
**/.next
**/.parity
# never into an image (re-check 4): env files and secrets, git, the agents' working notes, logs
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/.git
**/.superpowers
**/npm-debug.log*
